# Video, image and font assets for downloadable designs are fetched on
# demand (the Download button in the picker) from the URLs in
# designs/thirdparty-assets.json and verified against its digests. The
# wallsflow videos live on this repository's own GitHub release. Never
# commit any of them; that is the entire point of the download-on-demand
# design and it keeps a clone small.
*-assets/

# Local test output for the SDDM theme, never the real config.
sddm/lock-designs/theme.conf.user
sddm/lock-designs/current/
